We are excited to share that the **5th Next-Generation Transport Systems Conference (NGTS 2026)** was successfully held on May 22, 2026 at Purdue University, West Lafayette, IN. Academics, policymakers, and transportation industry professionals from around the world gathered to present research and discuss emerging technologies in transportation.

Learn more about the conference at the [official NGTS 2026 website](https://nextranspurdue.wixsite.com/ngts5).

